> **WHO CAN SELECT THESE ADVANTAGES AND DISADVANTAGES?**
>
> These advantages and disadvantages are written to be especially useful for Mantis characters. However, at the GM’s discretion, any character may select these advantages or disadvantages if they are suitable to their character concept.

## Mantis Techniques

###### Osano-wo’s Boast (Mantis) Rank 3

Activation: Once per game session as a Support action, you may make a TN 2 Command or Performance (Fire) check to boast of a deed you will attempt.

## Mantis Advantages and Disadvantages

##### Blood of Osano-wo (Fire) [Distinction]

The thunder roared in the distance, and the Kabutomushi shook upon the waves. Miya Natsume huddled against the mast, furiously sketching even as the beating rains drew close. He knew that he had to capture this moment, as the captain challenged the storm. Kabutomushi no Kiba's laughter boomed across the deck, and Natsume murmured another prayer for himself.

